Package: ftfy
Title: Fixes Text for You: Repair Mojibake and Related Damage in Text
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Robyn", "Speer", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "Author of Python ftfy, of which this package is a port"),
    person("Ed", "Barker", email = "epabarker@pm.me",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
    )
Description: Repairs mojibake, text that was decoded with the wrong
    codec, and related damage in character vectors. A port to R of the
    'Python' package 'ftfy' by Robyn Speer.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/epabarker/r-ftfy
BugReports: https://github.com/epabarker/r-ftfy/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    stringi (>= 1.5.3)
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/ftfy/upstream: 6.3.1
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
